- Draft
- Proposed
- Awaiting participant responses
- Confirmed
- Reschedule requested
- Cancellation requested
- Cancelled
- In progress
- Completed
- No-show
- Expired

Requirements:

- Define allowed transitions.
- Reject invalid state changes.
- Preserve every meaningful transition.
- Record the actor and timestamp for each transition.
- Define who can confirm, reschedule, or cancel an appointment.
- Support appointments requiring confirmation from multiple participants.
- Define when an appointment is considered confirmed.
- Prevent cancelled appointments from becoming active without an explicit restoration workflow.
- Distinguish cancellation from expiry.
- Distinguish no-show from cancellation.
- Do not mark an appointment completed solely because its scheduled end time has passed.
- Do not treat a proposed appointment as a confirmed booking.

